So that's how we're gonna start this game...

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.700
So yeah... this is who you are....

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:48.060
Either way you almost seem like a child lost in a world that doesn't want you in here and uh...

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.800
That can be terrifying by itself... Oh.... Okay

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:56.300
But... One thing that I've seen, and- and again I have explored too much about the game, but one thing

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.320
that I've seen is that the environments are just big and expansive.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:06.480
Not just in like, 'OH IT'S OPEN WORLD!', but literally to you, they are big and expansive because this world was-

